Error [E0405]: `??` only works on a fallible value, not `Loc`
  --> nested_interpolation_span.jet:6:48
    |
  6 |     "{if location == None -> "None" else -> "{(location ?? Loc{line: 0}).line}"}"
    |                                                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The left side must be a `Result` or optional value
 Fix: Call something that can fail, then write `... ?? fallback`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0405
